---
layout: layouts/product.njk
permalink: random-run.html
app: random-run
title: Random Run – Running Route Generator for iPhone & Apple Watch
description: "A free running route generator for iPhone and Apple Watch. Get three loop routes you've never run, follow them from your wrist, and upload to Strava automatically."
lastmod: 2026-08-12
alternates:
  - { lang: en, href: "/random-run.html" }
  - { lang: fr, href: "/fr/random-run.html" }
  - { lang: de, href: "/de/random-run.html" }
  - { lang: x-default, href: "/random-run.html" }
---
{%- from "macros.njk" import appstoreBtn, screenshot -%}

    <!-- ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="product-hero">
        <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="product-hero-text">
                <h1>Lace up — we'll figure out where.</h1>
                <p class="product-hero-desc">Pick a distance or a time and get three routes you've never run, each starting and ending right where you're standing.</p>
                {{ appstoreBtn("https://apps.apple.com/app/random-run/id6755962631", "Download on the App Store", "random-run") }}
            </div>
            <div class="product-hero-screenshot reveal">
                {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/02_route_preview", "Random Run three-route preview screen", 480, 1044, "(min-width: 1024px) 380px, 85vw", eager=true) }}
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Differentiator ────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="differentiator reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="differentiator-inner">
                <blockquote>Every run is a new route — no repeats, no history, and no algorithm deciding what you usually do.</blockquote>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── How It Works ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="how-it-works">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="how-section-header reveal">
                <span class="label">How it works</span>
                <h2>Find a route, run it, and let it log itself.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="steps-container">
                <div class="step reveal">
                    <div class="step-marker">
                        <span class="step-number">01</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-body">
                        <h3>Find</h3>
                        <p>Pick a distance or a time and get three routes you've never run, each starting right where you stand. Tap the one you like.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step reveal">
                    <div class="step-marker">
                        <span class="step-number">02</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-body">
                        <h3>Run</h3>
                        <p>Turn-by-turn directions on your phone, or on your wrist with no phone at all.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step reveal">
                    <div class="step-marker">
                        <span class="step-number">03</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-body">
                        <h3>Share</h3>
                        <p>If you've connected Strava, the run uploads on its own when you finish. It's optional: turn it on once, off again whenever.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="callout-box reveal">
                <div>
                    <p><strong>Connect Apple Health and route timing is based on your own pace,</strong> so a 30-minute route really takes you 30 minutes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Section Connector ─────────────────────────── -->
    <div class="section-route-connector" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 200 80" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path class="route-line route-line--run" d="M0,40 L40,40 L40,20 L80,20 L80,60 L120,60 L120,30 L160,30 L200,30" stroke-width="2"/>
        </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- ── Screenshots ───────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="screenshots">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="screenshots-header reveal">
                <span class="label">See it in action</span>
                <h2>The whole run, start to finish.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="screenshots-grid">
                <div class="screenshot-card reveal">
                    {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/01_distance_picker", "Random Run distance picker screen", 480, 1044, "202px") }}
                    <div class="screenshot-caption">
                        <div class="screenshot-caption-title">Set your goal</div>
                        <p class="screenshot-caption-desc">5 km, 30 minutes — whatever fits your day.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="screenshot-card reveal">
                    {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/02_route_preview", "Random Run route preview map", 480, 1044, "202px") }}
                    <div class="screenshot-caption">
                        <div class="screenshot-caption-title">Three routes, instantly</div>
                        <p class="screenshot-caption-desc">Pick whichever one catches your eye, or ask for three more.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="screenshot-card reveal">
                    {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/03_turn_by_turn", "Random Run turn-by-turn navigation", 480, 1044, "202px") }}
                    <div class="screenshot-caption">
                        <div class="screenshot-caption-title">Turn-by-turn navigation</div>
                        <p class="screenshot-caption-desc">Follow a brand-new route without stopping to check the map.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="screenshot-card reveal">
                    {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/04_run_summary", "Random Run summary screen", 480, 1044, "202px") }}
                    <div class="screenshot-caption">
                        <div class="screenshot-caption-title">Run complete</div>
                        <p class="screenshot-caption-desc">Your time, distance, and pace, all in one place.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="screenshot-card reveal">
                    {{ screenshot("/screenshots/random-run/05_live_activity", "Random Run Live Activity on lock screen", 480, 1044, "202px") }}
                    <div class="screenshot-caption">
                        <div class="screenshot-caption-title">Live Activity & Dynamic Island</div>
                        <p class="screenshot-caption-desc">Track your run from the Lock Screen.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Feature Beat: Apple Watch ─────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature-beat reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="feature-beat-inner">
                <div class="feature-beat-media">
                    <img src="/screenshots/random-run/watch_route_preview-416.webp" alt="Random Run standalone app on Apple Watch showing a generated running route" width="416" height="496" loading="lazy">
                </div>
                <div class="feature-beat-text">
                    <span class="label">Run</span>
                    <h2>Run it from your wrist.</h2>
                    <p>Random Run works on its own on Apple Watch, so you can generate a route, follow it turn by turn, and track the whole run without your phone.</p>
                    <p><strong>The phone can stay at home.</strong></p>
                    <p class="feature-beat-footnote">Works standalone on Apple Watch Series 6 and later, or from your phone whenever you'd rather.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Feature Beat: Strava ──────────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature-beat feature-beat--reverse reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="feature-beat-inner">
                <div class="feature-beat-media feature-beat-media--lockup">
                    <div class="strava-lockup" aria-label="Works with Strava — iPhone and Apple Watch">
                        <span class="strava-lockup-label">Works with</span>
                        <span class="strava-lockup-mark">STRAVA</span>
                        <span class="strava-lockup-sublabel">iPhone + Apple Watch</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-beat-text">
                    <span class="label">Share</span>
                    <h2>Finished runs go straight to Strava.</h2>
                    <p>Connect Strava once and every run after that uploads on its own, whether you ran with your wrist or your phone.</p>
                    <p><strong>It's off by default and one tap to turn off again.</strong> Nothing leaves your phone unless you say so.</p>
                    <p class="feature-beat-footnote">Strava integration is fully optional and disabled on first launch.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Strava ────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="feature-callout reveal">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="feature-callout-inner">
                <p><strong>Connect Strava once and every run uploads automatically.</strong> No extra steps when you finish.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Privacy ───────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="privacy-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="privacy-card reveal">
                <p>No account. No tracking. No ads.</p>
                <p>Your location never leaves your phone. Open the app and go.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Specs ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="specs-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="spec-grid reveal">
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">Platform</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">iOS 17.6+</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">Price</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">Free</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">Apple Watch</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">Standalone — no phone needed</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">Strava</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">Auto-upload, off by default</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">HealthKit</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">Pace-personalized routes</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="spec-label">Privacy</span>
                    <span class="spec-value">No account, no tracking</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
